data: {"id": "8cc5f0099492407d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2409", "run_id": "8cc5f0099492407d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据工具返回结果，分析如下：\n\n## 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2`\n- **UID**: `80b1ae6c-962d-4773-a9d0-195b269bb457`\n- **节点**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **当前状态**: **Pending**，仍处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态，**未恢复**\n- **容器**: `app`（镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`），从未成功运行过（Restart Count: 0）\n\n## 各维度调查结果\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 状态（kubectl_describe）✅ 有效\n- Pod 状态为 **Pending**，容器处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `CreateContainerConfigError`\n- 镜像已经被 kubelet 预拉取（\"already present on machin", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788426991318, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

