data: {"id": "8cc5f0099492407d-final", "run_id": "8cc5f0099492407d", "seq": 2414, "ts_ms": 1788427009484, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 持续处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `waiting_reason`: `CreateContainerConfigError` (`fact-b1618a02a90c`) | 直接确认容器启动失败的根本状态。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `waiting_message`: `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (`fact-d0a1e970e6f2`) | 明确给出导致创建配置失败的精确缺失字段名称及目标资源。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `Normal Pulled ... Container image ... already present on machine` (349次 over 78m) (`fact-8c4e49d9c0ea`) | 证明镜像拉取及底层环境正常，排除镜像故障，锁定配置阶段异常。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=`CreateContainerConfigError`) (`fact-6c1b0175edab`) | 通过 Prometheus 指标独立印证 K8s API 返回的状态。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. **K8s API 与指标的一致性**：事实 #2 提供了具体的报错原因（Missing Secret Key），事实 #1 确认了该原因的宏观状态。事实 #4 通过监控指标交叉验证了 Pod 处于相同的等待原因状态。\n2. **现象排除**：事实 #3 显示容器镜像长期存在且拉取成功（连续 349 次），结合 `restart_count` 为 0 的事实，证明 Pod 卡在启动前阶段，排除了应用逻辑崩溃或资源耗尽导致的问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用 Secret 'workload-input' 中的 key 'unavailable-key' → 缺少该 key 导致 Secret 解析/注入失败 → kubelet 抛出 CreateContainerConfigError 阻止容器启动 → Pod 持续处于 Pending/NotReady 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 配置引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`。**\n\n证据显示，Pod 在启动配置阶段，因无法在目标 Secret 中找到所需的 `unavailable-key` 字段（见事实 #2），直接触发了 `CreateContainerConfigError`（见事实 #1、#4）。由于容器未能进入运行态，未产生有效的应用日志或追踪数据，但这并不影响对配置错误的确定性结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 103.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 103.6s (Evidence 94.7s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 127.26, "metrics": {"run_id": "8cc5f0099492407d", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 127.25141334533691, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 127251.41334533691, "llm_calls": 21, "llm_duration_ms": 116970.43657302856, "tool_calls": 25, "executed_tool_calls": 22, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 22, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 23919.989109039307, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9692.724466323853}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "durat